{"seq":2,"slug":"thermal-comfort","title":"热舒适","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/thermal-comfort","wordCount":1464,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"热舒适\">热舒适</h1><p>把同一间办公室的空调设到 24°C，总有人加外套、有人摇扇子。这不是矫情，而是热舒适本质上是人体热平衡与心理适应共同作用的结果，远不只是&quot;室温&quot;一个数。本篇要把这种主观体验翻译成可计算、可设计的目标区间——告诉设计者&quot;环境到底该调到什么状态&quot;，而调到那个状态所需的能量账，则交给 <a href=\"building-energy-balance\">建筑能量平衡与能耗</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-人体热平衡的六要素\">核心概念：人体热平衡的六要素</h2><p>人体像一台持续产热的恒温机，核心体温必须稳定在约 37°C。当代谢产热与向环境的散热达到平衡，人就感到中性舒适。决定这一平衡的有六个要素，前四个是环境量、后两个是人体量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  M[代谢率 met] --&gt; B((人体热平衡))&#10;  Clo[服装热阻 clo] --&gt; B&#10;  Ta[空气温度 Ta] --&gt; B&#10;  Tr[平均辐射温度 Tr] --&gt; B&#10;  V[空气流速 v] --&gt; B&#10;  RH[相对湿度 RH] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt;|偏热| Hot[出汗 血管舒张]&#10;  B --&gt;|偏冷| Cold[寒颤 血管收缩]&#10;  B --&gt;|平衡| OK[热中性 舒适]\">flowchart TD\n  M[代谢率 met] --&gt; B((人体热平衡))\n  Clo[服装热阻 clo] --&gt; B\n  Ta[空气温度 Ta] --&gt; B\n  Tr[平均辐射温度 Tr] --&gt; B\n  V[空气流速 v] --&gt; B\n  RH[相对湿度 RH] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt;|偏热| Hot[出汗 血管舒张]\n  B --&gt;|偏冷| Cold[寒颤 血管收缩]\n  B --&gt;|平衡| OK[热中性 舒适]</pre><p>人体散热走四条路：对流（受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和风速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 影响）、辐射（受平均辐射温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 影响）、蒸发（受相对湿度影响）、导热。其中平均辐射温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常被忽视却极重要——靠近大玻璃幕墙或冷外墙时，即便空气是暖的，人也会因向冷壁面辐射散热而觉冷，这正是 <a href=\"heat-transfer-and-envelope\">传热与建筑围护结构热工</a> 里热桥和低保温壁面带来的舒适后果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>符号/单位</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>设计可调手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空气温度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (°C)</td>\n<td>18–28</td>\n<td>供暖/空调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均辐射温度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (°C)</td>\n<td>随壁面温度</td>\n<td>围护保温、地暖、辐射板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气流速</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> (m/s)</td>\n<td>0.1–1.0</td>\n<td>通风、风扇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对湿度</td>\n<td>RH (%)</td>\n<td>30–70</td>\n<td>加湿/除湿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代谢率</td>\n<td>met</td>\n<td>1.0（坐）–4.0</td>\n<td>不可设计，按活动取值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服装热阻</td>\n<td>clo</td>\n<td>0.5（夏）–1.0（冬）</td>\n<td>着装政策、季节性设定值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pmv-ppd-把舒适量化成一个数\">PMV-PPD：把舒适量化成一个数</h2><p>丹麦学者 Fanger 在实验室里让上千名受试者对热环境打分，从&quot;很冷&quot;到&quot;很热&quot;分为七级（-3 到 +3），拟合出预测平均评价 <strong>PMV（Predicted Mean Vote）</strong>。PMV 是上述六要素的函数，PMV=0 表示热中性。由于个体差异，即便 PMV=0 也总有人不满意，于是又定义了预测不满意百分比 <strong>PPD（Predicted Percentage of Dissatisfied）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>95</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.03353</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2179</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{PPD} = 100 - 95\\,\\exp\\!\\left(-0.03353\\,\\mathrm{PMV}^4 - 0.2179\\,\\mathrm{PMV}^2\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">PPD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2373em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.03353</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">PMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2179</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">PMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条曲线有个深刻含义：PPD 永远不可能低于 5%——再完美的环境也有 5% 的人不满意。ASHRAE Standard 55-2023 与 ISO 7730 据此把舒适区设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.5 \\le \\mathrm{PMV} \\le +0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">PMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（对应 PPD ≤ 10%）。ASHRAE 55-2023 在 2020 版基础上合并了 11 项修订，把计算方法精简为&quot;标准法&quot;和&quot;适应法&quot;两种，并新增了头脚垂直温差等局部不舒适的评估方法（来源：<a href=\"https://blog.ansi.org/ansi/ansi-ashrae-55-2023-thermal-environmental-conditions/\">ANSI Blog: ASHRAE 55-2023</a>）。</p>\n<p>PMV 适用于有空调、稳态的机械环境。它的局限在于把人当成被动的热机，忽略了人会主动适应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适应性模型-人不是被动的热机\">适应性模型：人不是被动的热机</h2><p>走进没有空调、靠开窗通风的自然通风建筑，人们的舒适预期会随室外气候漂移——夏天习惯了热，27°C 反而觉得正常。这种行为、生理、心理上的适应，PMV 无法描述。于是有了<strong>适应性舒适模型</strong>：舒适温度随室外滑动平均温度线性上升。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{comf} = a \\cdot T_{rm} + b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{rm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是室外滑动平均温度。ASHRAE 55-2023 的一项重要变化是扩大了适应性模型的适用范围：即便建筑装有机械制冷系统，只要该系统未运行，也可使用适应性模型评价（来源：<a href=\"https://blog.ansi.org/ansi/ansi-ashrae-55-2023-thermal-environmental-conditions/\">ANSI Blog: ASHRAE 55-2023</a>）。适应性模型的工程价值巨大——它把舒适区&quot;放宽&quot;，意味着自然通风、混合通风建筑可以在更大温度范围内不开空调，这是 <a href=\"building-energy-balance\">建筑能量平衡与能耗</a> 里降低空调能耗的关键杠杆，也直接关系到 <a href=\"../air-moisture-frontiers/ventilation-indoor-air-quality\">通风与室内空气品质</a> 中自然通风的可行窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"局部不舒适-整体达标也可能局部难受\">局部不舒适：整体达标也可能局部难受</h2><p>PMV 描述全身平均感受，但不舒适常常是局部的。即使 PMV=0，下面四种局部因素仍会让人抱怨：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>吹风感（draught）</strong>：脖颈、脚踝处的不期望气流，是空调房最常见的投诉，与风速、湍流度、温度有关。</li>\n<li><strong>垂直温差</strong>：头热脚冷。ASHRAE 55-2023 新增了头脚垂直温差的评估方法，一般要求头脚温差不超过 3°C。</li>\n<li><strong>地板温度</strong>：过冷或过热的地面影响足部舒适，地暖需控制表面温度上限。</li>\n<li><strong>辐射不对称</strong>：一侧是冷窗、另一侧是热顶板，造成身体两侧辐射散热失衡，冷窗和热桥壁面是主因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设计上，提升围护结构保温以抬高内壁面温度、用辐射供暖供冷替代强对流送风、合理布置送风口，都是同时改善整体与局部舒适的手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>热舒适是人体热平衡的结果，由空气温度、平均辐射温度、风速、湿度、代谢率、服装热阻六要素共同决定，辐射温度常被低估。</li>\n<li>PMV-PPD 模型把舒适量化为七级评价，舒适区取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.5 \\le \\mathrm{PMV} \\le +0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">PMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（PPD ≤ 10%），但 PPD 不可能低于 5%。</li>\n<li>ASHRAE 55-2023 精简为标准法与适应法两种，并扩大了适应性模型的适用范围、新增垂直温差评估。</li>\n<li>适应性模型承认人会主动适应室外气候，放宽自然通风建筑的舒适区，是节能与自然通风的关键杠杆。</li>\n<li>即便整体达标，吹风感、垂直温差、冷地板、辐射不对称等局部因素仍会造成不适，需结合围护保温与辐射末端综合改善。</li>\n<li>本篇确定的舒适目标区间，将由 <a href=\"building-energy-balance\">建筑能量平衡与能耗</a> 转化为达成它所需的负荷与能耗。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热舒适","id":"热舒适"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：人体热平衡的六要素","id":"核心概念-人体热平衡的六要素"},{"level":2,"text":"PMV-PPD：把舒适量化成一个数","id":"pmv-ppd-把舒适量化成一个数"},{"level":2,"text":"适应性模型：人不是被动的热机","id":"适应性模型-人不是被动的热机"},{"level":2,"text":"局部不舒适：整体达标也可能局部难受","id":"局部不舒适-整体达标也可能局部难受"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"传热与建筑围护结构热工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/heat-transfer-and-envelope"},"next":{"title":"建筑能量平衡与能耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/building-energy-balance"}}